The files in this directory are a manual transcription of the two data
tables printed in the source article, cross-checked cell-by-cell against a
second, independent transcription (see README.md "Both sources, fetched and
diffed" for the two sources, URLs, access dates, and the diff result — no
disagreements were found; values are reproduced exactly as printed,
including the paper's own sign conventions and printed decimal precision).

